+
+### TC-RF011-005: add_task() Persists to SQLite
+| Field | Detail |
+|-------|--------|
+| **ID** | TC-RF011-005 |
+| **Type** | Automated (Contract) |
+| **Steps** | `repo.add_task("Task A", "First")` → `repo.get_all_tasks()` |
+| **Expected** | Task retrievable via `get_all_tasks()` |
+
+### TC-RF011-010: clear_tasks() Removes All Tasks from DB
+| Field | Detail |
+|-------|--------|
+| **ID** | TC-RF011-010 |
+| **Type** | Automated (Contract) |
+| **Steps** | Add tasks → `repo.clear_tasks()` → `repo.get_all_tasks()` |
+| **Expected** | Returns `[]` |
